    <briefdescription>
<para>API-specific header for AV_HWDEVICE_TYPE_OPENCL. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pools allocated internally are always dynamic, and are primarily intended to be used in OpenCL-only cases. If interoperation is required, it is typically required to allocate frames in the other API and then map the frames context to OpenCL with <ref refid="hwcontext_8h_1a5228c42445cffd10087f0590614edb13" kindref="member">av_hwframe_ctx_create_derived()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
